          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zwana, mhlaba, bheka, ngehlisela okubi phezu kwalaba bantu, yebo, isithelo semicabango yabo, ngokuba abawalalelanga amazwi ami nomthetho wami, kepha bawulahla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
