          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokho usho kanje uJehova, uthi: “Bheka, ngibekela laba bantu izithiyo, oyise namadodana bawe phezu kwazo kanyekanye; umakhelwane nomngane wakhe bazobhubha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.21",
